<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 5.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 05	May 02   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.500     274.720     247.020   11.12 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.970     310.400     306.830    1.02 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.900     159.270     158.970   -0.04 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.098	47.238	47.182   -0.18 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  444.740     443.300     419.180    6.10 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.285     141.605     141.685   -0.28 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.055	16.097	16.185   -0.80 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  217.020     216.600     212.430    2.16 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.885	 1.889	 1.888   -0.16 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.582	 1.588	 1.581    0.06 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.520     186.860     183.135    1.85 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
